@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #fffefa
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #30203e
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6a5c70
  ArrowFontColor #30203e
  ArrowFontSize 13
  LifeLineBorderColor #8c7a97
  ParticipantBorderColor #6a5c70
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #eee7f9
  ParticipantFontColor #30203e
  ActorBorderColor #6a5c70
  ActorBackgroundColor #fffefa
  ActorFontColor #30203e
  GroupBorderColor #6a5c70
  GroupBackgroundColor #f6f3ee
  GroupHeaderFontColor #30203e
  DividerBorderColor #8c7a97
  DividerBackgroundColor #f6f3ee
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #fff7e3
  BorderColor #8c7a97
  FontColor #30203e
  FontSize 12
}

participant "Agent Integration" as Agent
participant "Plugin Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Application Core" as Core
participant "Active plugins" as Active

Agent -> Runtime: Request grouped activation
Runtime -> Core: Block new affected Root Actions

== Drain existing actions ==
Active --> Core: Root Actions and nested calls finish
note over Core, Active
  No abort or replay.
  A tool awaiting data keeps its current version.
end note

== Drain host requests ==
Core -> Core: Block new affected host requests
Active --> Core: Requests finish; Worker Leases released
Core -> Core: Revalidate checked code\nand dependency revisions

alt Relevant revisions changed
  Core --> Runtime: Needs recheck; no publication
  Runtime --> Agent: Obtain fresh applicable checks
else Checks still apply
  ref over Agent, Core
    Publish activation and refresh registrations
    (next diagram)
  end ref
end
@enduml
